window.products.push({"id":847012,"name":"HomeWorx by Harry Slatkin 4 Wick Candle, 18 oz, Coconut Shortbread, 18 ounce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81W69WsPkPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HomeWorx by Harry Slatkin 4 Wick Candle in Coconut Shortbread Take in the aromatic scent of baking -- without all the actual baking (and cleanup!) -- with this Coconut Shortbread fragranced candle Fragrance Notes: A blend of fresh coconut milk, buttery shortbread, lemon zest, and vanilla One 18-oz candle Four wicks Burn time 30 to 55 hours Glass vessel with decorative wrapped label; metal lid with Harry's personal monogram Each measures 5.5\" x 3.5\" Wicks can be trimmed to 1/4 inch before relighting, if needed. The best way to extinguish flames is by placing lid on candle. Candle Care: Burn within sight. Keep away from things that can catch fire. Keep out of the reach of children and pets. Container may be hot when the candle is lit. Keep all objects such as matches and wick trimmings clean from wax. Do not burn candle for more than 3-4 hours at a time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81W69WsPkPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homeworx","source_asin":"B0B2L92LWT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-847012","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2L92LWT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2L92LWT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
