window.products.push({"id":847094,"name":"Cooling Gel Memory Foam Mattress Topper, Bed Topper Removable & Washable Cover, High-Density Ventilated Mattress Pad Airflow Design Relieving Back Pai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81c4HxwuWYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High-Density Memory Foam: The memory foam mattress topper is made of 100% 40D memory foam, which has better resilience. The cooling mattress topper can better conform to the curves of your body, relieves body aches, and provides you with all-night comfort. The high support makes this cooling mattress pad more resistant to collapse and suitable for long-term use. Gel-cooling particles: Are you still troubled by the fact that the mattress topper made of common material will get hotter and hotter as you sleep? We injected gel particles into the memory foam, so that the firm mattress topper can maintain a continuous cool. The perforated design also makes the entire topper more breathable, so you will not have to worry about stuffiness. Bamboo fiber cover: We have equipped this cooling pad for bed with a removable bamboo fiber cover. It is cooler and more breathable than the common material of cover and dissipates heat well. At the same time this fabric is so soft that avoids pain caused by tossing and turning while sleeping. The removable and machine washable design also prevents dust and stains, keeping the mattress cooling pad clean and extending the life of the bed topper. Improve sleep quality: The memory foam topper is all designed for you to get a more comfortable sleep. The bamboo mattress topper provide you with support as well as optimal air circulation whenever and wherever you need it. Enjoy our breathable, supportive design that evenly distributes body heat and relaxes your muscles for a more restful sleep. Instruction for use: All memory foam mattress toppers on the market are vacuum packed with a little odor from the special memory foam inside, please don't worry, the smell will dissipate soon! But please note, please open it within 48 hours and leave it in a ventilated place for 24 hours. All of our foams are CertiPUR certified and we have a professional after-sales team, so if you have any questions please feel free to contact us!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81c4HxwuWYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sleemon","source_asin":"B0BCWCFMCW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-847094","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCWCFMCW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCWCFMCW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
