window.products.push({"id":847191,"name":"Sense Canvas Drum 6 Canvas Art - Home Decor Wall Art Print Poster Painting Medium 24x18 / 0.75\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":130.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+LUF1DybL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","description":"Details  Be inspired every day, make your room full of life. A simple piece of art can greatly change your environment and ultimately your mood. Each design we produce is unique and one of a kind, you won't see our designs anywhere around. Made by artists all around the world, we focus on creating the best designs at the highest resolution possible. Our canvases are handcrafted, stretched on a wooden frame so it gives a nice dimensional look. They come with a hanger kit and are ready to hang right out of the box. No assembly is required, so you can hang your canvas in any room without any hassle. We only use premium quality, eco-friendly materials. Printed on 99% cotton and 1% polyester, we use the same fabric artists use for paintings. Rest assured the quality of our canvases will feel like a real museum experience.   0.75\" vs 1.5\" Depth  Choosing between a thin wrap of 0.75 inches or a thick wrap of 1.5 inches is all about preference. If you like a slimmer look and more affordable pricing you should choose the 0.75\" depth option, but if you want a museum painting look, which looks better on larger canvases, you should opt-in for the 1.5 inches depth. You can also compare the perspective of the thickness in our close-up picture.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+LUF1DybL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sense Canvas","source_asin":"B0BP6W4PTF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-847191","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP6W4PTF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP6W4PTF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
