window.products.push({"id":847200,"name":"2PCS Multifunctional Kitchen Cooking Spoon, Skimmer Scoop Food Strainers for Cooking, Mashing, Draining, Grating, Non-stick Small Spatula Spoon Kitche","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HoBmbexML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Premium Materials】This multifunctional kitchen spoon is made of thermoplastic (food grade) with high temperature resistance. Safe to use and convenient to hold. The cooking spoon is lighter and does not transfer heat like a metal spoon. The plastic structure is so strong that it can be used for mashing and grinding. 【Multifunctional Cooking Spoon】There are two different specifications of the mesh holes onthe multifunctional kitchen cooking spoon and the head of the multifunctional spoon is bent, so that this kitchen utensil can be used for cooking, draining, mashing, and grating garlic. When scooping out food from a cooking pot or frying pan, it can also filter out excess oil. 【Practical Design】Sturdy but light weight, high-quality plastic frame, no need to worry about breaking when using. The bumps and holes at the bottom are designed specifically for grinding and mincing meat and potatoes. Non-slip handleand the design of structure allows you to hold the food easily. 【Easy to Clean】Fashionable style and considerate design. Just rinse it under your faucet. Hang on the wall when not in use and keep your kitchen organized. Good looking and beautiful. The spoons grate, mash, scoop all around great item. 【Multi Usage】This cooking spoon can be used to mash potatoes or beans. It also has the function of an egg beater and can be used to separate egg whites and egg yolks. Make sure you will use it on different occasions to save your cooking time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HoBmbexML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tendiren","source_asin":"B09H5RDZDD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-847200","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H5RDZDD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H5RDZDD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
