window.products.push({"id":847272,"name":"Cobnom Full/Queen Lightweight Down Alternative Comforter, Cooling Cotton Duvet for Warm Weather/Hot Sleepers, Thin Soft Breathable Microfiber Quilted ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PVPktzD8L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"LIGHTWEIGHT COMFORTER - This FULL/QUEEN size down alternative comforter is 88x88 inches and 200gsm (~34oz) fill weight, which is perfect for most people warm weather use or HOT SLEEPERS use it as an all-season comforter, or people who keep the bedroom over 64℉(18℃). The queen cooling comforter helps your body regulate its temperature, reduces anxiety without making you overheat when you sleep, so you can stay comfortable asleep. SOFT COTTON COMFORTER - Crafted from 100% cotton fabric cover - double brushed extra soft and breathable, filled with just amount of ultra-plush down-like microfiber, our thin cotton duvet is ultimately soft, breathable, lightweight, warm, durable, odorless, skin-friendly for a restful sleeping experience. It's a great choice who can't use feather down comforter. BREATHABLE COMFORTER - Combined nature cotton cover, the unique high-tech processed polyester & Eucalyptus Lyocell microfiber blend fiberfill allows the down alternative duvet to quickly absorb moisture and sweat and keeps itself dry. It's a result that enables the cotton quilt to perform well on breathability and temperature control to keep you cooling, dry, warm, and refresh every night. CLOUD COMFORTER - Adopts premium polyfill quilted for well-distributed, fluffy and lightweight, our down alternative duvet won't press you like a cloud. The end-to-end sewn-through box stitching keeps the filler secure to prevent it from shifting or clumping over time, ensuring a long-lasting use - even after multiple times machine washed. SERVICES & GUIDE - Machine washable and dryable. It can be used as a stand-alone comforter, or as a duvet insert with a favorite cover, or as a bed blanket. Great gift for your whole family & friends. If our summer duvet insert comforter is not what you want, please feel free to contact us via email, we will give you a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PVPktzD8L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cobnom","source_asin":"B088QBJX1Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-847272","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088QBJX1Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088QBJX1Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
