window.products.push({"id":847514,"name":"Sunny Home (3 Pack) Moisture Absorbers 9.17oz, Unscented, Odor Eliminator, Dehumidifier and Deodorizer for Closet, Bathroom, Kitchen in Home & RVs.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ah4Aq3jjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ Product Dimensions ] 3.54 x 5.31 x 3.93 inches, Capacity : 525ml, Constituent : Refined Calcium Chloride (A beads type ingredient that allows quick dehumidification with its large surface area. [Beads Type] The raw material of Sunny Home Moisture Absorber is a bead type that quickly absorbs moisture in the air and lowers the humidity in the space to make it comfortable. The raw material has a large contact area with the air, so it is quickly absorbed, When it absorbs moisture in the air that is 14 times its own weight, it is discharged into water. In the process of absorbing moisture and turning into water, the raw material remains in the form of a solid mass and then turns into water. [ Product Features ] Dehumidification starts from the moment the Tin-foil of the container is peeled off. With its excellent moisture absorbing power, it turns humid environment into dry and fresh. Waterproof felt and cover lid prevents the leakage. Place it in the basement, garage, closet, dressing room, kitchen, bathroom, shoe shelf, boat, car, etc. [ How To Use ] 1. Open the lid (Plastic Lid Green Part) and Peel off Tinfoil. 2. If you do not remove the tinfoil on top under Green lid, It will not work. 3. Grab the non-woven fabric and tear off Tinfoil. 4. Close the lid again and place it where you want to remove moisture. ★ Once you peel off the tinfoil on top under Green lid, it starts working. Do not remove white absorber pad (non-woven fabric). [ Made in Korea ] Authentic product manufactured by South Korea’s venture enterprise. A product that has gone through thorough product test withHousehold Chemicals Risk Assessment and Safety Standards tested by Korea Environmental Industry & Technology Institute. [ 100% Satisfaction Guaranteed ] 100% Refund or New Replacement BEYOND REFUND PERIOD if you are not happy with our product. Simply email us the problem, and we’ll take care of you. ★3 months Guarantee★ It doesn't mean that it doesn't work just because it hasn't turned into water, but it's trying to convert a lot of moisture into water at once because it has a large area in contact with the air. After the point at which it starts to turn into water, the time to change to water becomes faster. If it has not changed to water even after 3 months of purchase, Please send a message on Amazon. we will do our best to satisfy our valued customer's needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ah4Aq3jjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUNNY HOME","source_asin":"B09T9L8HDX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-847514","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T9L8HDX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T9L8HDX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
