window.products.push({"id":847574,"name":"Automatic Soap Dispenser,Touchless Infrared Sensor Gel Soap Dispenser, IPX4 Water-Resistant Hand sanitizer Dispenser ,Operated 500ML Capacity for Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Hos1Q3YHL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Automatic Hand Sanitizer Dispenser Features: ❤️The infrared sensor hydroalcoholic gel dispenser can accurately detect your hand. ❤️Equipped with an adjustable switch, you can easily control the amount of liquid just by pressing the \"switch\" button. ❤️Made of ABS plastic, it can extend the service life. Say goodbye to everyday wear and tear. It is designed with a waterproof base and a rubber gasket to prevent water from entering the battery box. ❤️Compatible with hydroalcoholic gel, it is an ideal option for your bathroom, kitchen, cafeteria, etc. ❤️ Can be used with 4 AA batteries (not included) and can be used for about 3 months. ❤️Easy to fill, just open the lid counterclockwise. Specification: Capacity: 500ml Weight: 500g Sensor range: 0-6 cm. Power supply: 4 AA batteries (not included). Operation method: 1) Open the battery compartment cover and insert 4 AA batteries. 2) Open the lid of the container and pour it into the soap dispenser, do not fill it. 3) Simply press the \"switch\" button to easily control the volume of the liquid. 4) Place your hand under the sensor and the soap dispenser will start to work automatically. Package contents: Hydroalcoholic gel dispenser * 1 User Manual * 1 Note: 1. If you do not intend to use it for a long time, please remove the battery to avoid water and liquid leakage. 2. Make sure nothing (including your hands) is blocking the spout; otherwise, no liquid will be dispensed. 3. Rinse the pump tubing regularly for 10-20 seconds to prevent the disinfectant from damaging the pump tubing. 4. Do not immerse or rinse","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Hos1Q3YHL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rommisie","source_asin":"B094VN5TP6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-847574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094VN5TP6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094VN5TP6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":847575,"name":"Central Air Conditioner Cover by Fineably – 600D Polyester Outdoor AC Cover with Waterproof Coating, Drawstring Hem, Padded Handles and Air Vents to R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gWZBiwsSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Extend the life of your AC unit Nuts, seeds, leaves and moisture can collect in the coils of your AC unit in the fall and winter, causing harmful corrosion and freezing. These can result in ill-timed breakdowns, costly repairs and even costlier premature replacement of your central air conditioner. A Fineably Air Conditioner Cover helps shield your AC from the damaging effects of Mother Nature, keeping it clean and debris-free. It will operate more efficiently in the summer, promoting lower electric bills and extending its longevity. Like armor for your air conditioner Fineably Central Air Conditioner Covers withstand severe climates and temperature extremes. Its dual-layer construction features a 600D polyester oxford cloth exterior and a waterproof inner membrane so snow cannot collect directly atop your AC unit and coils are protected from driving rains, hail and blizzards. Large air circulation vents prevent condensation build-up, and an integrated slit for the condensation drain pipe allows the Fineably AC Cover to fit neatly around the full perimeter of the unit for greater efficacy. Fast, frustration-free protection This 32\" x 32\" x 36\" AC cover fits most residential central air units, slipping over it in seconds without tools. A drawstring hem with click-to-close fastener offers a secure, reliable fit. When spring arrives, uncinch the hem and pull up on the handles to remove the cover. It folds easily for space-saving storage in your garage or deck box. Keep your cool when the summer sun beats down. Add the Fineably Central Air Conditioning Cover to your home maintenance essentials today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gWZBiwsSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FINEABLY","source_asin":"B0875K4QY6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-847575","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0875K4QY6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0875K4QY6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
