window.products.push({"id":847585,"name":"NATUREACT Home Coffee Roaster, 1.8lbs Large Capacity Portable Electric Coffee Bean Roaster Machine 1200W Multifunctional Coffee Roasters For Home Use ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X24Qf7l1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕【PROFESSIONAL DESIGN HOME COFFEE ROASTER】 - Voltage: 110V; Power: 1200W; Adjustable temperature: 0℃-240℃; Wide: 11.8\"; Height: 7.9\"; Diameter of the roaster pan: 8.86\"; Black food-grade Teflon layer, non-stick pan, safe, healthy and easy to clean. New upgraded baffle railing and stir bar - can evenly stir the bean during the baking process. ☕【ADJUSTABLE TEMPERATURE & EASY TO CONTROL】 - Automatic coffee roaster is great for beginners who are just starting to roast coffee at home.  It has a honeycomb chassis, keeps constant temperature for evenly heating.  0-240℃ range can be adjusted according to the different contents. When the lamp is lighted up, the roaster is in working condition. You can set the appropriate temperature with one button, it'll make sure the beans roasted evenly and reached the desired roast level. ☕【MULTIPLE APPLICATIONS】 - the coffee bean roaster is not only suitable for making coffee beans, but also can roast many foods, nuts, peanuts, popcorn, sunflowers, etc., a roasting machine can meet the roasting needs of a family, and it can also be used at home Cafes or restaurants can do the job well. ☕【HEAT RESISTANT COVER & ANTI-SCALDING HANDLE】 - The heat-resistant transparent cover of the coffee bean roaster has a good heat dissipation effect during the heating process, and it is convenient to observe the state and color of the coffee beans at any time. The roaster lid with 4 airhole, you can measure temperature with electronic thermometer freely without open the lid when baking. There are anti-scalding handles on both sides to widen and stabilze when roasting. ☕【PORTABLE LIGHT WEIGHT & LARGE CAPACITY】 - The roasting machine has a net weight of 6.1lbs. The coffee bean roaster has a size of 13\" x 6\" x 13\". It is easy to carry and takes up a small space. It can be easily stored and carried. Capacity: 816g/1.8lb ( Tips: the best roasting bean capacity is 300g/0.6lb-500g/1.1lb ). A powerful stirrer can easily handle large capacity of green coffee beans for fast roasting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X24Qf7l1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NATUREACT","source_asin":"B096ZYPLWS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-847585","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096ZYPLWS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096ZYPLWS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
