window.products.push({"id":847643,"name":"Radlove 59-Inch Large Electric Height Adjustable Computer L-Shaped Desk with Memory Controller Corner Standing Desk Modern Workstation with Splice Boa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":259.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UOfszo5AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【L-Shaped Corner Design】: Spacious 59” eco-friendly desktop offers a roomy setup for 2 monitors and a laptop so you can spread out and calmly take on the challenges of the workday. L-shaped corner design is very nice in a corner at your home and maximizes help you to save space, and the round corner design better protect your family from bruising.The tabletop is water and wear-resistant and comes with 2 wire collection holes to keep your office area neat and tidy. 【Electric Height Adjustable】: Height adjustable standing desk can adjust the height between 27''-45'' according to your needs and its ergonomic design delivers a peaceful experience to you wherever at home or office. There are four memory buttons on the desk for different family members to use, long-press until to hear a 'beep\" to remember the common height.Please allow a slight 0 to1-inch difference in desktop size due to manual measurement. 【Built For Work From Home】: The perfect standing desk to allow independent and remote workers to stay active, healthy, and productive while working from home. Standing Office Desk is suitable for people who need to sit for a long time to work or study. It can help them reduce the burden on their neck and waist and relieve the fatigue of sitting for a long time. Precisely adjust your desk to your height and insert healthy movement into your day. 【Anti-Collision Technology & Current Protection Function】: The stand-up desk has anti-collision technology and current protection functions. The built-in sensor is given higher sensitivity, which can accurately detect obstacles and automatically descend 2cm when obstructed. if any error codes appear, you can reset it. Unplug the power supply for the 20s, then plug the power supply back in and the desk will reset automatically. after it shows 69, the reset is done. 【Easy to Operate and Install】: The desk is easy to assemble, with step-by-step instructions and hardware included. Radlove has an excellent after-sales service team, please feel free to contact us if you have any questions, we will do our best to help you solve the problems you encounter. We hope to bring you the best shopping experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UOfszo5AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Radlove","source_asin":"B0C69LZ12B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-847643","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C69LZ12B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C69LZ12B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
