window.products.push({"id":847650,"name":"Decroom Premium Natural Goose Down Pillows, Luxury Hotel Gusseted Feather Bed Pillow for Sleeping with Breathable Cotton Cover, Standard Size Single P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G2GEtq1ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Luxury Hotel Gusseted Down Pillows - The cover of our bed pillow is 100% premium cotton fabric which is breathable, soft and comfortable. The filling of our cozy pillows is blend goose duck down feather and less top quality microfiber. It makes the pillow hypoallergenic and environmental friendly. Three Layers Design & Exquisite Craftsmanship - 3 Layers structure (middle-feather down, up and down-upgraded poly) makes the pillow insert extra firm and supportive.The perfect balance between fluffy and firmness could meed all the needs of back, side or stomach sleepers. Size & Package - Standard sized feather pillow is 20 x 26 inches. We provide package of single one and two to meet different customers' need. All the pillows are vacuum packed. Please remove the vacuum bag and fluff up your pillow a few times to get it a full plump look. We recommend give them 2-3 hours of sun bathing regularly for healthier use. Easy Care - Machine wash in the gentle cycle with cold water and dry clean(recommended to prolonged life to the pillows). Satisfaction Guaranteed - Enjoy Worry Free Online Shopping, just contact us within 180 days after purchase. If you have any concerns, full purchase price re fu nd is available.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G2GEtq1ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Decroom","source_asin":"B089K9D7T8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-847650","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089K9D7T8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089K9D7T8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
