window.products.push({"id":847771,"name":"Brooklyn Aurora 13\" Luxury Cooling Gel Hybrid Mattress, Twin Medium","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DD1rmNihL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The coolest take ever on affordably luxury was derived from science—the average skin temperature is 91 degrees, but the ideal sleep temperature is 88 degrees. To maintain the optimal skin sleep temperature of 88 degrees, we infused a phase change molecule called TitanCool™ on the surface of the Brooklyn Aurora to moderate your temperature: cooling gel beads liquefy at higher temperatures to deliver cooling relief; those same beads solidify at lower temperatures to ensure an ideal sleep environment. A premium top utilizes the most advanced fabric on the market to deliver cooling benefits on contact. The result is the most elite sleep experience yet, The Brooklyn Aurora is crafted with five layers: a 1.5” Copper Gel Energex™ layer, infused with TitanCool™ for optimal cooling comfort; a 2” TitanFlex™ layer of comfort foam for exceptional pressure point relief; a 1” transitional layer of Gel Memory Foam for deeper compression support; up to 1,189 individually encased Quantum™ Edge coils for better reactivity and motion isolation; and a 1” high-density base foam for added durability as well as reinforcement of coils as they compress. All Brooklyn Bedding mattresses are custom made in our USA factory, using the highest quality materials. Our personal approach to designing, stitching and crafting is backed by a 10-year, no hassle warranty. Our foams are CertiPUR-US certified, which means that our mattress is made without ozone depleters, PBDEs, TDCPP or TCEP (\"Tris\") flame retardants, mercury, lead, heavy metals, formaldehyde or phthalates regulated by the Consumer Product Safety Commission.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DD1rmNihL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brooklyn Bedding","source_asin":"B077MZ9FTZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-847771","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077MZ9FTZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077MZ9FTZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
