window.products.push({"id":847877,"name":"RXSTONES 4-5\" Dyed Blue Agate Coaster for Drinks Set of 4 Stone Sliced Coasters Geode Crystal Decor with Rubber Bumpers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mdU5wFO9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"What is Agate? Agate is a common semiprecious silica mineral that has long been used as a gem and ornamental.Most agates occur in cavities of eruptive rocks or ancient lavas.These agates have a banded structure, successive layers being approximately parallel to the sides of the cavity.During crystallization, the colored bands are not disturbed. Varieties of agate are characterized by peculiarities in the shape and color of the bands, which are seen in sections cut at right angles to the layers. Many agates, when cut in cross-section, reveal striking forms, such us our product agate coaster, it is a beautiful artwork of nature. What You Receive: Quantity: Set of 4 blue agate coasters, weight about 1.3 lbs total. Come with clear rubber bumpers(please put them on the bottom of coasters to protect your furniture from scratches or scuffs.) Size: Diameter approx 4-5 inches(100-120mm), 0.2 inches(5mm) in thickness(Each slice coasters is Irregular shape, close to round or arc as a whole.) Decorative Coasters For Drinks ,Dessert or Wine:Suitable for your red wine coasters, cups, or small capacity coffee cups, very good decorative materials. Your drink will look more delicious after use this coaster. Home Decor & Artwork: Pick it up as a work of art, suitable for living room, bedroom, office, exhibition, nice display. DIY & Gift:If you like handwork, You can write the name of the person you miss, or the constellation you like, your blessing. Or as a wedding gift, holiday gift, birthday gift. NEED ATTENTION ?Each piece agate coaster vary in color & patterns, they did not look like any of the picture, they are never truly alike only add mystique. ?The coasters are Dyed color ,Because the hardness of each batch of agate material is different, the color will be dark or light after dyeing, which is normal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mdU5wFO9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RXSTONES","source_asin":"B09D99MJG9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-847877","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D99MJG9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D99MJG9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
