window.products.push({"id":847921,"name":"Cooling Weighted Blanket King Size 50lbs 88x94 - The Heaviest Weighted Blanket for Couples On The Market - Bamboo Cooling Fabric on One Side and Soft ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OMGoRPK0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HOMESMART PRODUCTS We spent thousands of hours researching, designing, then tweaking the design, and ultimately creating our line of Premium Weighted Blankets and Covers. REST SMART WITH HOMESMART Blanket Weight Won’t Shift Blanket Weight Won’t Shift 400 Thread Count Ultra Soft Cotton 400 Thread Count Ultra Soft Cotton Super Durable & Machine-Washable Super Durable & Machine-Washable Designed to Fit Beds as a Comforter Designed to Fit Beds as a Comforter Weighted With Non-toxic, No-leak Micro-Glass Beads Weighted With Non-toxic, No-leak Micro-Glass Beads SIZE MATTERS!! You want a blanket that will fit your bed as a comforter. Unfortunately, most sellers do not accurately classify their blanket sizes and buyers are left with a blanket that does not hang over the edges of their mattress. Here is an easy guide to follow when selecting the blanket size for your bed:King Bed – select a blanket that is at least 104x80”Queen Bed – select a blanket that is at least 86x80”Full/Double Bed – select a blanket that is at least 80x80”Twin Bed – select a blanket that is at least 60x80” WHAT BLANKET WEIGHT IS RIGHT FOR YOU? Well, this all depends on the amount of pressure you want AND the size of blanket you are selecting. Here are our recommendations for weight selection: Light Pressure: King Size 15lbs & 20lbs | Queen 15lbs | Twin/Personal Size 10lb, 12lb Medium Pressure: King Size 25lbs | Queen Size 20lbs | Twin/Personal Size 15lb, 17lb, 20lb Heavy Pressure: King Size 30lbs & 35lbs | Queen 25lbs | Twin/Personal Size 25lb WHAT’S THE THREAD COUNT? HomeSmart’s weighted blankets are 400 thread count. This means it has a softer feel than most other blankets - the average weighted blanket on the market today only has a thread count of 200 – there is a reason they are not listing the thread count of their blankets.You are covered by our 100% Money Back Lifetime Warranty by an American Company. You can trust us - over 50,000 happy customers already do!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OMGoRPK0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HomeSmart Products","source_asin":"B07MDFLN56","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-847921","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MDFLN56","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MDFLN56","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
