window.products.push({"id":847933,"name":"Envirosax Reusable Grocery Bags- Set of 3 Pacific Travel Palm Springs Designs Eco-Friendly, Multi Use Tote","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ySrM0tuHL._AC_UL1250_.jpg","description":"Envirosax Reusable Bag Set of 3 Colorful Designs Introducing the well-known Envirosax eco-friendly bags in a set of 3 delightful designs. Synonymous with quality and one of the oldest reusable bag brands, Envirosax make a wonderful gift item or keep them for yourself!A convenient eco friendly reusable bag that folds up to a small size and can be stored neatly in your handbag, pocket, or glove compartment. A variety of uses, this great little bag is super strong and weighs in at just 1.4oz. Holding two plastic grocery bags of shopping, Envirosax have been tested to hold at least 44lbs. As Light as a Lipstick and as Strong as a Suitcase!Do you ever get to the store and realize you have forgotten your bags? Or maybe you have a bit of \"eco-envy\" as you see fellow shoppers walk plastic-free out of the store, with a trendy eco bag. Our Envirosax bag can fix these problems in an instant! As well as being super strong and very stylish, these bags are printed with eco-friendly inks making them super environmentally friendly! And any issues you had with forgetting your bags? Well, not with these little beauties! These fabulous bags roll up to the size of a sushi roll - you can pop one in your handbag or tote so you are ready to shop plastic-free at a moment's notice! IS THIS PRODUCT FOR YOU？ Do you live in an area where there is a plastic bag ban? Do you run to the grocery store only to have left your reusable bag at home? Do you often wish you had another tote when you are travelling? Do you need a spare bag in the car just to keep toys or diapers in? With a zillion uses, our high-quality eco bags are sold in great value bundles. Buy to use one and keep the others on hand, or give them away as gifts. Envirosax is synonymous with quality and by buying these bags, you know you are not only saving the environment, but also buying a product that will last a very long time. It’s also for you if you’re trying to find the perfect gift fo","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ySrM0tuHL._AC_UL1250_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Envirosax","source_asin":"B07HGT9XQV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-847933","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HGT9XQV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HGT9XQV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
