window.products.push({"id":847986,"name":"Shortie's Candle Company Pinyon & Patchouli Wax Melts Multi Pack - Formula 117-2 Highly Scented Bars - Made with Natural Oils - Incense & Earth Air Fr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817HV27LCWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The woody Southwest scent of pinyon pine pairs well with a touch of musky aromatic patchouli oil, derived from an exotic Asian relative of the mint family. Our Premium Pinyon & Patchouli Wax Melts are highly scented, made with Essential and Natural fragrance oils, and are completely phthalate free, vegan, and non toxic! Each pack of Wax Melts contain 6 1/2 Oz. warmer wax cubes, and each will provide strong fragrance for 8+ hours. Our Premium Wax Melts are a completely safe flameless fragrance wickless candle option for any space and pets of all types. Our Formula 117 wax blend is made with a soft paraffin, and is designed for maximum scent throw. This new formula also comes out of the package much easier than our classic formula. Truly an experiment, but one we really like!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817HV27LCWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shortie's Candle Company","source_asin":"B01B2SVE2Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-847986","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01B2SVE2Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01B2SVE2Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":847987,"name":"Embossed Rolling Pin Roses Multi-Purpose Engraving Eco-Friendly Naturally Made Baking Accessory Tool For Pastries & Arts ablazingbee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YJeWTon0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ablazingbee Embossed Rolling Pins Whether you are a professional baker or novice getting into baking and trying to raise the “WOW!” factor; let our embossed rolling pins help you achieve that goal! Have your baking goods look as fabulous as they taste.  All of our rolling pins are made with non-absorbent and extra sturdy beech wood. This allows for a lightweight tool to help you effortlessly leave deep, satisfying and unique patterns on your baking goodies. The handles are designed with you in mind; it offers a non-slip grip to maintain comfort and control every time. It is all natural, easy to store and does not include any preservatives or oil coatings.  Makes for the perfect birthday, housewarming, Christmas, Mother's Day gift for friends and families. Make every baking occasion a memorable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YJeWTon0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ablazingbee","source_asin":"B08DG6HGTN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-847987","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DG6HGTN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DG6HGTN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":847988,"name":"Dreamhood King White Feather and Down Blend Lightweight Comforter, Hotel Collection Down Duvet Insert, 100% Cotton Shell with Corner Tabs, 106x90 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":114.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JMT-mLLFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SOFT & COMFORTABLE: Our comforter is filled with 95% white goose feathers fiber and 5% white goose down, which is lightweight and you can feel no stress all night. It provides light warmth, which is perfect for use in warmer weather, or as an all-season feather down duvet insert.Quite suitable for hot sleepers. SPECIAL DESIGN: The comforter cover is made of plush cotton, breathable and quiet, with no feathers poking you. Sewn-through construction helps prevent the down from shifting. Double stitch design can prevent the filling falling out and is cored with nice piping. MULTIPLE SIZES - Our lightweight comforter is available in twin, full, king sizes. Twin size: 68\"x90\", filled with 33oz filling. Full/Queen size: 90\"x90\", filled with 44oz filling. King size: 106\"x90\", filled with 52oz filling. There is always one for you. RESPONSIBLY: Dreamhood comforter follows the Responsible Down Standard and is certificated by OEKO-TEX100, OXIPOWER, and TWICE AS NICE that ensures textiles comply with high safety and environmental standards. CARE INSTRUCTION: Dry Cleaning. Clean your comforter as infrequently as possible, as this can also damage the down filling. It is recommended that fluff or shakes the duvet regularly to expand the down cluster. Protecting your comforter with a duvet cover also can extend its life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JMT-mLLFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dreamhood","source_asin":"B09G9HPPCZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-847988","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G9HPPCZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G9HPPCZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":847989,"name":"ZONEGRACE 2 Pack 30oz Insulated Tumbler cups with Lids and Straw, Stainless Steel Vacuum Double Wall Travel Tumbler, Durable Insulated Coffee Travel M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AkWtkzsiL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"👍 PREMIUM MATERIAL: The insulated tumbler cups is made from high quality 18/8 304 food grade stainless steel. Lead free and durable. Rust-proof, easy wash and unbreakable. 👍 INSULATED STAINLESS STEEL TUMBLERS: Zonegrace 20oz coffee travel mug is with Double-Wall vacuum technology to keep drinks hot for over 6 hours and cold for around 24 hours. 👍 BPA FREE SLIDING LID, ECO-FRIENDLY AND SPLASH PROOF: Extra sealed and the lid cover provide maximum splash-proof capability. Drink hole on the top for easy sipping. Straw friendly. 👍 SUPERIOR POWDER COATED FINISH: Sweat proof, easy grip, the advanced technology prevents heat transfer to outer wall, condensation free and long lasting. Electro polished inside delivers elegant look. Designed for car cup holders. 👍 LIFETIME WARRANTY & 100% SATISFACTION: If you have any questions, please contact our customer service and we will reply shortly. We are happy to provide 100% money back if you are not fully satisfied with the tumbler.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AkWtkzsiL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZONEGRACE","source_asin":"B07WWC4QTC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-847989","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WWC4QTC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WWC4QTC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":847990,"name":"Hoover F6040-900 SteamVac Widepath LS with CleanSurge Carpet Cleaner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZEDAMPGJL._AC_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com Designed for pet owners and active households, this hot-water vacuum cleans carpets and scrubs bare floors with an extra-wide, 14-inch cleaning path after they've been dry-vacuumed. The vacuum applies hot tap water and cleaning concentrate (16 ounces of carpet/upholstery and bare-floor concentrates included) into carpet fibers or onto bare floors with six rotating brushes at two speeds (plus \"off\" when brushing isn't needed) and then vacuums up the dirty water. A powered hand-tool comes along for scrubbing extra-soiled areas, stairs, and auto interiors. This model also has a scrub module that fits onto the hand-tool for removing scuff marks and spills on hard floors and a bare-floor attachment. No faucet hookup is required. Both clean-water and dirty-water tanks detach for filling and emptying, and the machine shuts off automatically when the dirty-water tank is full. The vacuum cleans going forward and backward and automatically adjusts for carpet heights, bare floors, and an accompanying stair/upholstery nozzle (great for auto interiors). It has a finger-trigger for applying the cleaning solution and a surge button to spray more solution on spots and heavy-traffic areas. The on/off switch is toe-operated for convenience. A 10-foot tool hose and 30-foot power cord provide an extra-wide cleaning reach. Assembly requires just two nuts and bolts and one Phillips-head screw (all included), and the instruction booklet is easy to follow. The vacuum carries a 1-year warranty against defects. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZEDAMPGJL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hoover","source_asin":"B00005NWXN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-847990","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005NWXN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005NWXN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
